  "body": "In the specification there is a term - [HTML fragment parsing algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#html-fragment-parsing-algorithm).\r\nThere is also a partial use of this term: **parser was originally created for the HTML fragment parsing algorithm**.\r\nHonestly it's hard to understand when\r\n1. parser was originally created for the HTML fragment parsing algorithms\r\n2. parser was not originally created for the HTML fragment parsing algorithms\r\n\r\nThe specification in this respect does not give any examples for understanding this aspect.",
